RAPTOR Flowchart Program
Title: Lexicographically Smallest String by Swapping
Variables: s (String), i (Integer), j (Integer), min_idx (Integer), temp (Character)
Logic:
  1. Input: s
  2. Outer Loop: i := 0 to length(s)-1
  3. Inner Loop: j := length(s)-1 down to i+1
  4. If min_idx != i Then Swap and Exit
  5. Output: s
